OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's football group receives
OL,4,AKing's Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ladies football group which has grown
OL,7,Finto a community of more than 500 women
OL,8,Fis among a number of volunteer-run
OL,9,Forganisations that have been honoured
OL,10,Fwith the King's Award for Voluntary
OL,11,FService (KAVS).
OL,13,FLadies Football 4 Fun is made up of
OL,14,Fwomen of all ages and abilities who
OL,15,Fregularly meet up to play the sport in
OL,16,Ffriendly matches across Birmingham,
OL,17,FSolihull, Coventry, Warwickshire and
OL,18,Fthe Black Country.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
