OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's football group receives
OL,4,AKing's Award
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Macleod-Peters, who runs one of
OL,7,Fthe sessions, said the group's success
OL,8,Freflected the number of women that were
OL,9,F"waiting in the wings" for an
OL,10,Fopportunity to come and play football.
OL,12,F"We were over the moon. It's such a
OL,13,Fproud moment," she said of the
OL,14,Frecognition.
